769
00:48:46,584 --> 00:48:49,536
天啊！
Oh, God.

770
00:48:50,528 --> 00:48:52,493
不过，尽管如此，
'Despite everything though,

771
00:48:52,528 --> 00:48:55,592
我还是偶然碰到了我那担心的同事们……
'I managed to stumble across
my concerned colleagues... '

772
00:48:55,627 --> 00:48:58,512
那是个帐篷，居然自己动！
It's a tent, moving by itself!

773
00:48:58,547 --> 00:49:01,049
刚从沙漠里出来。
Just been in the desert.

774
00:49:01,084 --> 00:49:03,517
穿越沙漠。
Crossing the desert.

775
00:49:03,552 --> 00:49:06,568
……结果发现杰里米已经做好晚饭了。
'.. and found Jeremy
had made supper. '

776
00:49:12,588 --> 00:49:15,584
这事儿让我们瞬间变得很哲学。
This made us very philosophical.

777
00:49:17,576 --> 00:49:21,512
我跟你说啊，要是三个智者
I tell you what, if
the three wise men

778
00:49:21,547 --> 00:49:24,537
现在就去这趟旅程，
had done the journey now,

779
00:49:24,572 --> 00:49:29,556
他们根本懒得跑过去，学校的圣诞剧选角也会轻松多了。
they wouldn't have bothered going there and
school Nativity plays would be easier to
cast.

780
00:49:29,591 --> 00:49:32,544
现在，你得搞好驴子的前半段，
Now, you've got to have
front half of donkey,

781
00:49:32,579 --> 00:49:35,469
后半段的驴子，牧羊人……
back half of donkey, shepherds...

782
00:49:35,504 --> 00:49:38,477
我曾经在学校的圣诞剧里演老鼠。说说这事儿。
I was a mouse once in a school
Nativity play. Explain that.

783
00:49:38,512 --> 00:49:42,576
老鼠？因为他们想要个超小的角色啊。
A mouse? Well, because they wanted
something unbelievably small.

784
00:49:42,611 --> 00:49:45,556
我记得我穿了个纸板做的老鼠头套。
I remember, I had a cardboard
mouse-head costume.

785
00:49:45,591 --> 00:49:47,553
我当时是驴子的前半部分。
I was the front of the donkey.

786
00:49:47,588 --> 00:49:51,536
我中途把套装脱了，让大家看见是我本人。
I took the costume off halfway
through, so people could see it was me.

787
00:49:51,571 --> 00:49:53,516
没人分得出差别！
Nobody could tell the difference!

788
00:49:55,516 --> 00:49:58,576
我猜你是扮演小国王吧？我当的是牧羊人，
I suppose you were the infant K
ing,were you? I was a shepherd,

789
00:49:58,611 --> 00:50:00,548
因为我被狠狠教训了一顿。
cos I had a dressing down.

790
00:50:11,540 --> 00:50:16,524
第二天早晨，太阳在宝马的黎明交响曲中升起。
The next morning, the sun rose to
the sound of the BMW dawn chorus.

791
00:50:17,536 --> 00:50:20,469
“武装。解除武装。”
"Armed. Disarmed. "

792
00:50:20,504 --> 00:50:24,548
发动机先闷住了，随后咆哮起来
ENGINE CHOKES THEN ROARS

793
00:50:26,568 --> 00:50:29,572
天啊，听起来像柴油机车。
Oh, my God. It sounds
like a diesel locomotive.

794
00:50:29,607 --> 00:50:30,549
它动起来了。
It's going.

795
00:50:30,584 --> 00:50:35,532
我觉得沙漠根本对你那非洲军团的车没啥好处。
I don't think the desert's doing your
Afrika Korps car any good at all.

796
00:50:38,596 --> 00:50:40,525
尽管做了改装，
Despite the modifications,

797
00:50:40,560 --> 00:50:44,512
我们的小跑车在这里更不合适，
our little sports cars were
even less suitable here

798
00:50:44,547 --> 00:50:46,548
比起在战区时还要糟。
than they had been
in the war zones.

799
00:50:47,576 --> 00:50:50,489
啊！哦……啊……
Ah! Ohh... Ahhh...

800
00:50:50,524 --> 00:50:52,481
哦！哦，这可不好。
Oh! Oh, this is not good.

801
00:50:52,516 --> 00:50:56,516
你就听不到石子把你车的底护板撕得稀巴烂吗？
"Can you not hear stones ripping the
undertray of your car to pieces?"

802
00:50:57,584 --> 00:51:00,520
噢！
Oh!

803
00:51:02,536 --> 00:51:04,544
太糟了！
This is so bad!

804
00:51:04,579 --> 00:51:06,477
我卡住了。
I'm stuck.

805
00:51:06,512 --> 00:51:07,592
这像水一样滑。
It's like water.

806
00:51:15,508 --> 00:51:16,564
来了。
Here we go.

807
00:51:16,599 --> 00:51:18,557
哎呀。
Ohhh.

808
00:51:18,592 --> 00:51:21,064
轮胎打滑，走起。
WHEELSPIN Go.

809
00:51:21,099 --> 00:51:23,536
小心点！抱歉！
Watch it! Sorry!

810
00:51:25,520 --> 00:51:27,549
快点，快点，快点！
Go, go, go!

811
00:51:27,584 --> 00:51:30,512
我被咬了，手臂肿成了球。
I've been bitten.
My arm's swollen up.

812
00:51:30,547 --> 00:51:31,592
这里背上也有一个。
I've got one on my back, here.

813
00:51:31,627 --> 00:51:34,493
啊！哎哟！
Ahh! Ow!

814
00:51:34,528 --> 00:51:36,529
我们被狠狠揍了。
'We were taking a battering.

815
00:51:36,564 --> 00:51:40,572
情况马上要更糟了。
'And things were about
to get a lot worse. '

816
00:51:40,607 --> 00:51:43,544
从那儿抢过来。
Snatch from there.

817
00:51:46,536 --> 00:51:47,533
然后转向。
And turn.

818
00:51:47,568 --> 00:51:49,541
我挖了一个大洞。
I've dug a big hole.

819
00:51:49,576 --> 00:51:53,525
好啦，停，停，停。
All right, stop. Stop. Stop.

820
00:51:53,560 --> 00:51:57,544
稍微斜拉一下，他会更好地翻到轮子上。
Just pull him at a slight angle, we'll
tip him on to his wheels better.

821
00:51:57,579 --> 00:51:59,549
好，往那边去。
Right, go that way.

822
00:51:59,584 --> 00:52:01,520
好的，快跑，快跑，快跑，快跑，快跑。
OK. Go, go, go, go, go.

823
00:52:01,588 --> 00:52:03,517
嘭——
THUD

824
00:52:03,552 --> 00:52:05,516
停，停。停，停！
Stop, stop. Stop, stop!

825
00:52:14,524 --> 00:52:17,536
没事吧，詹姆斯？你感觉如何？恶心。
You all right, James?
How are you feeling? Sick.

826
00:52:17,571 --> 00:52:19,584
想坐起来吗？
Do you want to sit up?

827
00:52:26,572 --> 00:52:29,576
我们在哪儿？叙利亚的沙漠里。
Where are we?
In the desert in Syria.

828
00:52:29,611 --> 00:52:32,536
你知道我们要去哪吗？
Do you know where we're going?

829
00:52:40,552 --> 00:52:45,512
显然，詹姆斯情况不妙，被送进了医院，
'Plainly, James was in a bad
way, so he was taken to hospital,

830
00:52:45,547 --> 00:52:48,536
留下哈蒙德和我只能单独继续。
'leaving Hammond and I
to carry on alone. '

831
00:52:52,536 --> 00:52:55,500
第二天，气氛相当阴沉。
The next day, the mood was gloomy.

832
00:52:58,504 --> 00:52:59,568
噢！
Oh!

833
00:53:01,520 --> 00:53:05,536
我们不能否认，沙漠已经把我们的团队折磨得够呛。
I don't think we can deny it, the
desert has taken its toll on our team.

834
00:53:05,571 --> 00:53:07,561
一条命掉了，
One man down,

835
00:53:07,596 --> 00:53:11,540
杰里米被啥东西咬了，手臂都要腐烂了。
Jeremy's been bitten by something
and his arm's rotting off.

836
00:53:14,540 --> 00:53:15,588
这简直是暴打。
It's a beating.

837
00:53:17,552 --> 00:53:20,533
不过很快，消息传来，詹姆斯已在恢复，
Soon, though, news reached
us that James was recovering,

838
00:53:20,568 --> 00:53:26,576
随后在荒无人烟的地方，咱们发现了惊人的东西。
and then in the middle of nowhere,
we came across something amazing.

839
00:53:43,596 --> 00:53:45,561
哈蒙德？嗯？
Hammond? Yep?

840
00:53:45,596 --> 00:53:48,560
你知道那是啥吧？
You know what that is, don't you?

841
00:53:48,595 --> 00:53:50,541
这是一条路，真的。
It's a road. And it is real.

842
00:53:50,576 --> 00:53:53,549
这是一条路。看看多平。没有石子。
It is a road. Look how smooth it is.
There's no rocks.

843
00:53:53,584 --> 00:53:58,516
路面光滑，却有蝎子。等一下，等一下……
It's smooth and there are noscorpions
in it. Hang on, hang on...

844
00:53:58,551 --> 00:54:00,580
你忘了我们在沙漠里偷偷摸摸。
You're forgetting we're
in the desert to sneak.

845
00:54:00,615 --> 00:54:03,512
我们走在路上，肯定被人看见。
We go on the road,
people will see us.

846
00:54:03,547 --> 00:54:05,548
这路不能用，不能用。
We can't use it. We can't use it.

847
00:54:05,583 --> 00:54:07,489
要是……
What if...

848
00:54:07,524 --> 00:54:12,508
我们在车里伪装，走上这路？
we go on the road and disguise
ourselves in the cars?

849
00:54:13,572 --> 00:54:14,596
太聪明了。
That's brilliant.

850
00:54:17,552 --> 00:54:22,564
于是我们付诸行动，去医院接詹姆斯。
So, we put our plan into action and
went to pick James up from hospital.

851
00:54:27,556 --> 00:54:29,592
你们俩穿的啥？
What are you two wearing?

852
00:54:32,580 --> 00:54:35,481
你的呢？真好笑。
Where's yours? Very funny.

853
00:54:35,516 --> 00:54:37,477
你把它留在那儿了？我好点儿了。
Have you left it in there?
I'm better.

854
00:54:37,512 --> 00:54:40,508
不过是脑袋轻轻碰一下，我已经好了。
It's only a small bang on
the head, and I'm mended.

855
00:54:40,543 --> 00:54:41,545
小划破而已。
A small cut, that's it.

856
00:54:41,580 --> 00:54:45,560
你真这么好？完全好。那我是谁？
You really are better?
Completely. Who am I?

857
00:54:45,595 --> 00:54:47,489
你这根大鸡巴。
You're a big cock.

858
00:54:47,524 --> 00:54:49,465
我是谁？恼人的小混蛋。
Who am I? Irritating little sod.

859
00:54:49,500 --> 00:54:51,485
他更好。是吧？
He's better.
He is better, isn't he?

860
00:54:51,520 --> 00:54:54,537
总之，我们有了新计策。沙漠那招不灵。
Anyway, we've got a cunning new plan.
The desert wasn't working.

861
00:54:54,572 --> 00:54:59,520
所以？我们决定伪装继续走原路。
And? So we've decided we going to
carry on with our route in disguise.

862
00:54:59,555 --> 00:55:00,548
就是我们。
It's us.

863
00:55:07,536 --> 00:55:13,524
今晚的《继续前进》：你到底在干嘛？这根本不是《爸爸军》的妈妈……
Tonight on Carry On Are You Being
It Ain't Half Dad's Army's Mother...

864
00:55:13,559 --> 00:55:15,557
看，没啥好看的。
See, nothing to see.

865
00:55:15,592 --> 00:55:18,050
只是一位姑娘开着怪车。
Just a girl driving an unusual car.

866
00:55:18,085 --> 00:55:20,508
谁会多看两眼？
Who's going to look twice at that?

867
00:55:22,548 --> 00:55:25,469
我们已经上了通往大马士革的路
We were now on the road to Damascus

868
00:55:25,504 --> 00:55:28,572
而新发现的速度惹了麻烦。
and the new-found speed
was causing problems.

869
00:55:30,548 --> 00:55:34,512
这六个轮子晃得我相当厉害。
I've got quite bad wobble
from the six wheels here.

870
00:55:34,547 --> 00:55:36,564
越来越糟！
It's getting quite bad!

871
00:55:38,512 --> 00:55:40,505
哈蒙德，你的帐篷受得住吗？
Hammond, how's your
tent taking the strain?

872
00:55:40,540 --> 00:55:44,572
我不确定贝都因帐篷能撑住60-80公里每小时。
I'm not sure Bedouin tents
are made to do 60-80kph.

873
00:55:45,568 --> 00:55:50,548
“我们决定继续前进，但杰里米的车却不配合。”
'We decided to press on, but then,
Jeremy's car decided otherwise. '

874
00:55:50,583 --> 00:55:52,563
我的引擎罢工了。
My engine's gone.

875
00:55:52,598 --> 00:55:54,544
引擎……哎呀！
The engine... Oh, no!

876
00:55:56,520 --> 00:56:00,548
“路边，哈蒙德拆掉了自己的帐篷，
'At the roadside, Hammond
dismantled his tent,

877
00:56:00,583 --> 00:56:03,545
杰里米把他那该死的额外轮子卸掉，
'Jeremy removed his
stupid extra wheels,

878
00:56:03,580 --> 00:56:06,508
于是我们围着他的引擎转。
'and then we all gathered
round his engine. '

879
00:56:06,543 --> 00:56:08,489
火花塞又炸了。
The spark plug has blown out again.

880
00:56:08,524 --> 00:56:11,536
“不过这次，问题更严重了。”
'This time, though, the
problem was more serious. '

881
00:56:11,571 --> 00:56:13,508
来点转速。
Give it a rev.

882
00:56:15,576 --> 00:56:18,504
它又出来了。
It's come out again.

883
00:56:19,556 --> 00:56:23,584
我跟你说实话，发动机翻脸了。
I tell you exactly what's happened,
the engine has changed its mind.

884
00:56:23,619 --> 00:56:25,517
在通往大马士革的路上，
On the road to Damascus,

885
00:56:25,552 --> 00:56:28,528
它决定要变成三缸发动机。
it's decided it wants to
be a three-cylinder engine.

886
00:56:29,524 --> 00:56:31,588
‘修不了，就算了。’
'Unable to fix it, we moved on. '

887
00:56:37,580 --> 00:56:40,572
这就是我的世界了。
This is my world now.

888
00:56:43,536 --> 00:56:47,536
‘很快，我被甩得远远的。不过，…’
'And soon, I was left far behind.
But then... '

889
00:56:47,571 --> 00:56:49,556
等一下，那是什么？
Hang on, what's that?

890
00:56:49,591 --> 00:56:52,520
哦，天呐，不！不！
Oh, God, no, no!

891
00:56:55,556 --> 00:56:59,528
‘…菲亚特的轮胎竟然不想要气了。’
'.. the Fiat's tyre had changed
its mind about having air in it. '

892
00:56:59,563 --> 00:57:00,596
糟了！
Bugger!

893
00:57:03,508 --> 00:57:04,501
哦，不！
Oh, no!

894
00:57:04,536 --> 00:57:07,528
省空间的，天呐！
Space saver. Oh, God!

895
00:57:07,563 --> 00:57:10,047
卡车喇叭响起
TRUCK HORN BLARES

896
00:57:10,082 --> 00:57:12,532
直接撞上我了！
Right up me burka!

897
00:57:13,560 --> 00:57:15,512
这就行了。
That'll do it.

898
00:57:21,564 --> 00:57:25,512
‘这次爆胎让杰里米追上来了
'The puncture allowed
Jeremy to catch up

899
00:57:25,547 --> 00:57:28,508
‘很快我们就到了大马士革。’
'and soon, we arrived
in Damascus. '

900
00:57:29,520 --> 00:57:32,473
这座城已经有七千年历史了。
7,000 years, this city's been here.

901
00:57:32,508 --> 00:57:36,500
来到这样的地方还能混进去，真是惊人。
It's amazing to arrive at such
a place and just blend in.

902
00:57:36,584 --> 00:57:40,548
说实话，去大马士革的路一点也不顺畅。
It wasn't the smoothest journey
to Damascus, if I'm honest.

903
00:57:42,508 --> 00:57:45,028
不过，往好处想，
Still, look on the bright side,

904
00:57:45,063 --> 00:57:47,548
我想我们已经悄悄地到了。
I think we have made it unnoticed.

905
00:57:49,532 --> 00:57:52,557
数百英里的沙漠我们无声无息地穿过去
Hundreds of miles of
desert crossed anonymously

906
00:57:52,592 --> 00:57:56,558
现在我们到了旅店。只要把车藏起来就行。
and we're at the hotel.
All we have to do is hide the cars.

907
00:57:56,593 --> 00:58:00,524
我们成功了，我们… 哎呀，天呐，快看，哈蒙德！
We have done it. We've made...
Oh, God, no, look, Hammond!

908
00:58:00,559 --> 00:58:02,592
“在你上面。” 哎呀，天哪！
"Above you. " Oh, God!

909
00:58:05,516 --> 00:58:07,548
我们可没这么干吧？你好。
We haven't done that,
have we? Hello.

910
00:58:07,583 --> 00:58:09,549
你好。
Hello.

911
00:58:09,584 --> 00:58:13,548
我白白地穿着变装上了电视。
I've appeared on television
in drag for nothing.

912
00:58:15,516 --> 00:58:19,564
于是我们丢掉伪装，去集市逛
We, therefore, abandoned our
disguises and went to the souk

913
00:58:19,599 --> 00:58:22,572
买黄金、乳香和没药。
to buy gold,
frankincense and myrrh.

914
00:58:22,607 --> 00:58:25,481
耳环…
Earrings...

915
00:58:25,516 --> 00:58:28,508
我觉得耳环不太对劲。
I don't think earrings are right.

916
00:58:30,512 --> 00:58:32,512
你知道没药是什么吗？
Do you know what myrrh is?

917
00:58:32,547 --> 00:58:34,477
没药？没药。
Myrrh? Myrrh.

918
00:58:34,512 --> 00:58:36,540
黄金、乳香和没药。
Gold, frankincense and myrrh.

919
00:58:36,575 --> 00:58:38,567
不，我也不知道。
No. I don't know either.

920
00:58:38,602 --> 00:58:40,583
你有乳香吗？
Do you have frankincense?

921
00:58:40,618 --> 00:58:42,564
Frankise...? 乳香。
Frankise...? Frankincense.

922
00:58:42,599 --> 00:58:44,556
不行。好的。
No. OK.

923
00:58:46,512 --> 00:58:48,477
啊，你这上面有没药吗？
Ah, have you got myrrh on it?

924
00:58:48,512 --> 00:58:52,592
没有，你倒是有 Calvin Klein、Hugo Boss，但没没药。
No, you've got Calvin Klein,
Hugo Boss, but no myrrh.

925
00:58:54,588 --> 00:58:56,557
相当贵啊。
Quite expensive.

926
00:58:56,592 --> 00:58:59,588
我终于给杰里米找了份礼物。
I've finally seen a
present for Jeremy.

927
00:58:59,623 --> 00:59:01,592
圆滑的油。
Oil of tact.

928
00:59:03,560 --> 00:59:08,516
买完东西后，我们在一家
专门做羊肉的餐厅碰头，
'Shopping over, we met up at a
restaurant that specialised in lamb,

929
00:59:08,551 --> 00:59:12,560
这下子，船长费迪倒是第一次露出笑容。
'which meant that, for once,
Captain Faddy was happy. '

930
